# Moreno sociogram: project communication choices identify a coordinator star and a weakly connected specialist.
sociogram "Project Team Communication"
  config: highlight = stars, isolates
  ana
  bo
  cy
  dion
  erin
  faye
  ana -> cy
  bo -> cy
  dion -> cy
  erin -> cy
  cy <-> faye
  ana <-> bo
  dion -> faye
